msgstr "Windows, macOS i Linux"

msgid "Work in the language you think in."
msgstr "Radite na jeziku na kojem mislite."

msgid "Yes. Keep Postika open and your computer awake while a queue is scheduled or running. Queues and posting logs are not restored after quitting."
msgstr "Da. Neka Postika bude otvorena, a vaše računalo budno dok je red čekanja zakazan ili pokrenut. Redovi čekanja i dnevnici objavljivanja ne vraćaju se nakon napuštanja."

msgid "Yes. Multiple accounts can run their posting queues in parallel. Each account has a separate browser session, groups, drafts, and posting settings. Switching accounts doesn’t interrupt the other queues."
msgstr "Da. Višestruki računi mogu paralelno pokretati svoje redove objavljivanja. Svaki račun ima zasebnu sesiju preglednika, grupe, skice i postavke objavljivanja. Promjena računa ne prekida druge redove čekanja."

